---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Simon Plourde" description="About Simon Plourde — background, experience, and resume.">
  <div class="container">

    <section class="about-header">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p>I'm Simon, born and raised in Montreal. My relationship with tech started early — building my first PC as a teenager to game, then experimenting with mining rigs, and eventually becoming the go-to tech person for friends and family. I've been down that rabbit hole ever since.</p>
      <p>Outside of IT, I'm a traveler. I spent a year in New Zealand on a working holiday visa, then another six months backpacking through East Asia — Thailand, Vietnam, and beyond. Experiencing different cultures and ways of life has a way of changing how you see things, and I wouldn't trade any of it.</p>
      <p>I'm also drawn to finance — the stock market, crypto, the whole ecosystem. There's something fascinating about trying to understand a system that affects everyone's life whether they're paying attention or not.</p>
      <p>Lately, AI has taken over a big part of my curiosity. I want to push myself to actually build with it — not just follow the hype, but use it the way I used computers when I was a kid: to make things, solve problems, and see what's possible. This website is part of that.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Experience</p>
      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">Job Title</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">2023 – Present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Company Name</div>
        <div class="resume-entry-desc">Brief description of what you did and what impact you had.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">Previous Job Title</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">2020 – 2023</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Previous Company</div>
        <div class="resume-entry-desc">Brief description of responsibilities and achievements.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Education</p>
      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">Degree / Program</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">2016 – 2020</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">University / School Name</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Skills</p>
      <div class="skills-wrap">
        <span class="skill">Skill 1</span>
        <span class="skill">Skill 2</span>
        <span class="skill">Skill 3</span>
        <span class="skill">Skill 4</span>
        <span class="skill">Skill 5</span>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
